
  <sn><md>### Transport Mechanisms of Pollutants

**Pollutant transport** is the movement of pollutants from their source to another location through the **atmosphere, hydrosphere, geosphere, or biosphere**. Transport determines the **distribution, exposure, persistence, and eventual fate** of pollutants.

```text
                    POLLUTANT SOURCE
                          │
             ┌────────────┼────────────┐
             ↓            ↓            ↓
        Atmosphere    Hydrosphere   Geosphere
             │            │            │
             └────────────┼────────────┘
                          ↓
                      Biosphere
```
</md></sn>
